            <note corresp="#d321-f2" n="29" xml:id="d321-f2-content">
                <p>Not printed; for the most part identical with the manifesto printed on <ref
                        target="#pg308">p. 308</ref>, but concluding: “Knowing that Your
                    Excellencies have China’s interest at heart, we are taking this opportunity to
                    make another appeal for your friendly advice and guidance at this critical
                    moment.”</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d321-f3" n="30" xml:id="d321-f3-content">
                <p>Not printed; in substance the same as <hi rendition="#italic">communiqué</hi>
                    published by Japanese Foreign Office on Mar. 6; see <ref target="#pg317">p.
                        317</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d321-f4" n="31" xml:id="d321-f4-content">
                <p>See <ref target="#pg304">pp. 304</ref>–<ref target="#pg307">307</ref>.</p>
            </note>
